        },
        {
          "title": "The shaded area is",
          "body": "The shaded area is\n\n\\[\n(200+200\\sqrt2)-25\\sqrt2-(50+50\\sqrt2)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=150+125\\sqrt2\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=326.7766\\ldots\n\\]"
